07242d593f5f"],

Cell["\<\
The Brauer product between two diagrams d1 and d2 is performed by following \
the path of the edges when merging the two diagrams. If the edges form a loop \
the resulting diagram picks a additional factor BrauerParameter.\
\>", "Text",
